0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 620 Td (is the most constrained by choices already made.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 600 Td (If saturation ties, prefer the session with the most still-unassigned neighbors \(its) Tj ET
