0.12 0.30 0.48 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 54 549 Td (5. Order candidate slots to spread a class weekly workload) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 530 Td (Start with all 20 slots in Fisher-Yates shuffled order, then discard slots that fail the) Tj ET
