0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 504 Td (each day. The least-loaded days come first; the earlier shuffled order breaks equal-load) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 491 Td (ties.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 471 Td (This balancing preference is a heuristic, not a hard rule. It encourages a more even weekly) Tj ET
