0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 646 Td (Start with the UTC dates November 16 and December 16, 2026. If even minimum two-day gaps) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 633 Td (between all exams would exceed this window, stop with an explanatory error: with n subjects) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 620 Td (the minimum span is \(n - 1\) times 2 days.) Tj ET
