0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 574 Td (later transition. If a three-day gap still fits, randomly add either 2 or 3 days; otherwise) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 561 Td (add 2 days.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 541 Td (A two-day date difference leaves one free calendar day between exams; a three-day difference) Tj ET
