0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 458 Td (the last position and moving left, it picks a random position from zero through the current) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 445 Td (position and swaps those two items. This is the Fisher-Yates shuffle.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 425 Td (That helper randomizes ties between equally ranked sessions, candidate-slot tie order, room) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 54 412 Td (choice order, and exam subject order. Pressing Generate again can therefore produce a) Tj ET
